Middleware functions are functions that have access to:
a)The request object (req)
b)The response object (res)
c)The next middleware function in the application’s request-response cycle, commonly named next

Middleware functions can perform the following tasks:
a)Execute any code.
b)Modify the request and response objects.
c)End the request-response cycle.
d)Pass control to the next middleware function.

